(7251689, 1127220, 16046, '<td valign="top">Top 3</td>', 'Top 3', '2014-08-15 12:00:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7251709, 1127335, 92577, '<td valign="top">I like the picture very much but the idea of hdr is to reveal details in the shadows. IMO the butterfly should show more detail</td>', 'I like the picture very much but the idea of hdr is to reveal details in the shadows. IMO the butterfly should show more detail', '2014-08-15 13:42:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7251771, 1127140, 54446, '<td valign="top">Nicely done!  My top vote of 10.  Clearly a high dynamic range to the scene, managed with great skill.  Love the area.  That is Glacier Gorge topping off at Longs Peak, Pagoda Mountain and McHenry''s Peak.  I especially like the Shark''s tooth.</td>', 'Nicely done!  My top vote of 10.  Clearly a high dynamic range to the scene, managed with great skill.  Love the area.  That is Glacier Gorge topping off at Longs Peak, Pagoda Mountain and McHenry''s Peak.  I especially like the Shark''s tooth.', '2014-08-15 17:34:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7251773, 1127220, 54446, '<td valign="top">Beautiful pipe organ and cathedral.  Great perspective and control of tones.  9</td>', 'Beautiful pipe organ and cathedral.  Great perspective and control of tones.  9', '2014-08-15 17:36:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7251775, 1127262, 54446, '<td valign="top">Really a great scene, well rendered.  Forgive me for saying so, but my opinion is the person is a distraction.  I understand why you included the person.  But, it really catches my eye and prevents me (initially) from inspecting the great lines and shapes. 7</td>', 'Really a great scene, well rendered.  Forgive me for saying so, but my opinion is the person is a distraction.  I understand why you included the person.  But, it really catches my eye and prevents me (initially) from inspecting the great lines and shapes. 7', '2014-08-15 17:40:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7251784, 1127246, 54446, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done.  Great items of interest along the coastal shore.  Superb HDR subject.  8</td>', 'Very nicely done.  Great items of interest along the coastal shore.  Superb HDR subject.  8', '2014-08-15 18:29:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7251791, 1127291, 54446, '<td valign="top">Amazing place.  Very nicely rendered.   May need a slight notch of increased contrast.  Some of the cyan in the sky seems odd to me, but a very great effort from the other side of the world. 8</td>', 'Amazing place.  Very nicely rendered.   May need a slight notch of increased contrast.  Some of the cyan in the sky seems odd to me, but a very great effort from the other side of the world. 8', '2014-08-15 18:32:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7251792, 1127144, 54446, '<td valign="top">Very attractive.  Great detail in the house and landscaping.  8</td>', 'Very attractive.  Great detail in the house and landscaping.  8', '2014-08-15 18:33:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7251829, 1127277, 54446, '<td valign="top">Well, if you did combine several images, then you are to be congratulated for excellent ghost reduction.  Exposure is great throughout.  Spectacular composition.  I think this should be the blue ribbon.  10</td>', 'Well, if you did combine several images, then you are to be congratulated for excellent ghost reduction.  Exposure is great throughout.  Spectacular composition.  I think this should be the blue ribbon.  10', '2014-08-15 19:04:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7251831, 1127338, 54446, '<td valign="top">Halos abound.</td>', 'Halos abound.', '2014-08-15 19:08:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7251833, 1127100, 54446, '<td valign="top">Really good macro insect shot.  Far removed from HDR photography.</td>', 'Really good macro insect shot.  Far removed from HDR photography.', '2014-08-15 19:15:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7251850, 1127128, 167257, '<td valign="top">now that is cool  I like how the chin sits on the frame.</td>', 'now that is cool  I like how the chin sits on the frame.', '2014-08-15 20:38:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7251853, 1126991, 167257, '<td valign="top">what is that?  cool!</td>', 'what is that?  cool!', '2014-08-15 20:45:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7251887, 1127310, 114225, '<td valign="top">Some things just down need HDR, and this is one of those things.</td>', 'Some things just down need HDR, and this is one of those things.', '2014-08-16 09:14:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7251888, 1127329, 114225, '<td valign="top">Good scene, a but on the dark side with odd coloring in the sky.</td>', 'Good scene, a but on the dark side with odd coloring in the sky.', '2014-08-16 09:14:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7251889, 1127140, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great scene. The sky appears a bit dark</td>', 'Great scene. The sky appears a bit dark', '2014-08-16 09:15:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7251890, 1127262, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very cool lines here.</td>', 'Very cool lines here.', '2014-08-16 09:15:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7251891, 1127108, 114225, '<td valign="top">I feel like HDR could have been used more to an advantage here to bring out better contrast.</td>', 'I feel like HDR could have been used more to an advantage here to bring out better contrast.', '2014-08-16 09:16:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7251892, 1127311, 114225, '<td valign="top">Windowed buildings, always a good choice for HDR. I really like this composition.</td>', 'Windowed buildings, always a good choice for HDR. I really like this composition.', '2014-08-16 09:16:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7251893, 1127238, 114225, '<td valign="top">One of the hardest things to manage with HDR is s sunset/sunrise sky. A little more attention to the sky could have made it realistic instead of highlighter color.</td>', 'One of the hardest things to manage with HDR is s sunset/sunrise sky. A little more attention to the sky could have made it realistic instead of highlighter color.', '2014-08-16 09:17:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7251894, 1127276, 114225, '<td valign="top">Good scene. The color is a bit overdone.</td>', 'Good scene. The color is a bit overdone.', '2014-08-16 10:00:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7251895, 1127239, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great leading lines.</td>', 'Great leading lines.', '2014-08-16 10:00:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7251896, 1127335, 114225, '<td valign="top">Super saturated red is really distracting.</td>', 'Super saturated red is really distracting.', '2014-08-16 10:01:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7251897, 1127284, 114225, '<td valign="top">A bit heavy on the tone mapping, which is too bad for such a great overlook.</td>', 'A bit heavy on the tone mapping, which is too bad for such a great overlook.', '2014-08-16 10:01:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7251898, 1127280, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice and natural.</td>', 'Nice and natural.', '2014-08-16 10:01:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7251899, 1127232, 114225, '<td valign="top">HDR is best suited for high contrast scenes. Here, it just detracts.</td>', 'HDR is best suited for high contrast scenes. Here, it just detracts.', '2014-08-16 10:03:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7251900, 1127035, 114225, '<td valign="top">Way over processed.</td>', 'Way over processed.', '2014-08-16 10:11:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7251901, 1127338, 114225, '<td valign="top">Eww, pink clouds and heavy halos. Take more care with you processing, and you can avoid that.</td>', 'Eww, pink clouds and heavy halos. Take more care with you processing, and you can avoid that.', '2014-08-16 10:12:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7251905, 1127270, 114225, '<td valign="top">A lot of interest in the scene, but the overly heavy contest hides a lot of it.</td>', 'A lot of interest in the scene, but the overly heavy contest hides a lot of it.', '2014-08-16 11:08:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7251906, 1127288, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very well done. So far the best of the images I loved on. There is a bit of a halo effect around the lighthouse, but not too much to be distracting.</td>', 'Very well done. So far the best of the images I loved on. There is a bit of a halo effect around the lighthouse, but not too much to be distracting.', '2014-08-16 11:08:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7251907, 1127201, 114225, '<td valign="top">Way way over processed.</td>', 'Way way over processed.', '2014-08-16 11:09:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7251908, 1127246, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great curve of the shore to capture, great clouds. The HDR processing needs a bit of work to be more realistic, especially in the sky.</td>', 'Great curve of the shore to capture, great clouds. The HDR processing needs a bit of work to be more realistic, especially in the sky.', '2014-08-16 11:12:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7251909, 1126787, 114225, '<td valign="top">Over processed, but somehow, in a way, the is somewhat attractive.</td>', 'Over processed, but somehow, in a way, the is somewhat attractive.', '2014-08-16 11:13:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7251910, 1127233, 114225, '<td valign="top">Rule number one about HDR, watch out for halos. If you see them, pull back the sliders a bit.</td>', 'Rule number one about HDR, watch out for halos. If you see them, pull back the sliders a bit.', '2014-08-16 11:14:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7251911, 1127224, 114225, '<td valign="top">Feels like everything is dark.</td>', 'Feels like everything is dark.', '2014-08-16 11:14:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7251912, 1127263, 114225, '<td valign="top">Overall good. One of the hardest things to handle in HDR is the sunrise/sunset sky. In this case, some dodging could have improved the sky.</td>', 'Overall good. One of the hardest things to handle in HDR is the sunrise/sunset sky. In this case, some dodging could have improved the sky.', '2014-08-16 11:15:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7251913, 1127006, 114225, '<td valign="top">HDR is a good choice for indoors and outdoors, but you could have used a wider range of bracketing to make sure the outside looked better.</td>', 'HDR is a good choice for indoors and outdoors, but you could have used a wider range of bracketing to make sure the outside looked better.', '2014-08-16 11:16:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7251914, 1127275, 114225, '<td valign="top">Cool scene. A bit unnatural with the heavy handed tone mapping.</td>', 'Cool scene. A bit unnatural with the heavy handed tone mapping.', '2014-08-16 11:17:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7251915, 1127212, 114225, '<td valign="top">Not sure where this is going.</td>', 'Not sure where this is going.', '2014-08-16 11:17:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7251916, 1127341, 114225, '<td valign="top">Way over the top processing.</td>', 'Way over the top processing.', '2014-08-16 11:17:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7251920, 1127240, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like the composition  choice. The sky should be blessed "structured". And the non-sky portion could be brighter.</td>', 'I like the composition  choice. The sky should be blessed "structured". And the non-sky portion could be brighter.', '2014-08-16 11:32:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7251921, 1127334, 114225, '<td valign="top">A really cool composition. I don''t like how dark the trees are for an HDR image, but +1 for the bold composition.</td>', 'A really cool composition. I don''t like how dark the trees are for an HDR image, but +1 for the bold composition.', '2014-08-16 11:32:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7251925, 1127325, 114225, '<td valign="top">Really nice reflections. Some dodging in the sky could help even out the scene.</td>', 'Really nice reflections. Some dodging in the sky could help even out the scene.', '2014-08-16 11:45:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7251926, 1127277, 114225, '<td valign="top">Looks menacing. I could use a bit more brightness. It would help combat the bit of halo around the fishermen.</td>', 'Looks menacing. I could use a bit more brightness. It would help combat the bit of halo around the fishermen.', '2014-08-16 11:46:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7251927, 1127097, 114225, '<td valign="top">The subject doesn''t lend itself all that well to HDR processing.</td>', 'The subject doesn''t lend itself all that well to HDR processing.', '2014-08-16 11:47:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7251928, 1126984, 114225, '<td valign="top">Good scene, but very bland end result. The histogram here seems really flat, with nothing having pop.</td>', 'Good scene, but very bland end result. The histogram here seems really flat, with nothing having pop.', '2014-08-16 11:48:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7251930, 1126925, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like the orange against the blue. The sky could be a bit more natural though.</td>', 'I like the orange against the blue. The sky could be a bit more natural though.', '2014-08-16 11:48:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7251931, 1127110, 114225, '<td valign="top">Really great scene. Not sure why you chose to vignette so much, that hides a lot of beauty. And there are HUGE halos around the shore.</td>', 'Really great scene. Not sure why you chose to vignette so much, that hides a lot of beauty. And there are HUGE halos around the shore.', '2014-08-16 11:49:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7251933, 1127210, 114225, '<td valign="top">I must say, this is one of the most boring images I have seen. Mainly because of the ice box. IF you went for a more minimal feel by only have that odd box and the wall, then it would be more interesting.</td>', 'I must say, this is one of the most boring images I have seen. Mainly because of the ice box. IF you went for a more minimal feel by only have that odd box and the wall, then it would be more interesting.', '2014-08-16 11:51:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7251934, 1127032, 114225, '<td valign="top">Really good scene, with really good HDR in everything except the very top. Clouds can be hard to deal with in a scene like this, but  some careful attention can help.</td>', 'Really good scene, with really good HDR in everything except the very top. Clouds can be hard to deal with in a scene like this, but  some careful attention can help.', '2014-08-16 11:51:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7251936, 1127215, 114225, '<td valign="top">Interesting softness in the sky. I can understand the softness in the weeds, but the sky is odd.</td>', 'Interesting softness in the sky. I can understand the softness in the weeds, but the sky is odd.', '2014-08-16 11:54:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7251937, 1127241, 114225, '<td valign="top">I really dislike the posterized look. Feels like it''s used to cover up flaws.</td>', 'I really dislike the posterized look. Feels like it''s used to cover up flaws.', '2014-08-16 11:54:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7251938, 1127147, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice looking dow, but the HDR processing make it look dingy.</td>', 'Nice looking dow, but the HDR processing make it look dingy.', '2014-08-16 11:55:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7251960, 1127264, 114225, '<td valign="top">A bit more careful processing could go a long way here. For instance, the top of the building and the towers is so much darker than the rest of the building, that should be. Also the clouds/ sky are unnatural.</td>', 'A bit more careful processing could go a long way here. For instance, the top of the building and the towers is so much darker than the rest of the building, that should be. Also the clouds/ sky are unnatural.', '2014-08-16 12:35:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7251961, 1127331, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like this. HDR not overdone. Good texture.</td>', 'I like this. HDR not overdone. Good texture.', '2014-08-16 12:35:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7251965, 1126954, 114225, '<td valign="top">Not bad. A little over the top with the saturation in the clouds (I see details lost to it).</td>', 'Not bad. A little over the top with the saturation in the clouds (I see details lost to it).', '2014-08-16 12:40:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7251966, 1127128, 114225, '<td valign="top">The fine hairs off the head are neat, but otherwise I find this to have too much tone mapping or structure.</td>', 'The fine hairs off the head are neat, but otherwise I find this to have too much tone mapping or structure.', '2014-08-16 12:41:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7251967, 1126991, 114225, '<td valign="top">The contrast and tone mapping got out of control here. For contrast, there is barely any. The histogram looks flat. The tone mapping causes things to bleed together.</td>', 'The contrast and tone mapping got out of control here. For contrast, there is barely any. The histogram looks flat. The tone mapping causes things to bleed together.', '2014-08-16 12:42:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7251968, 1127236, 114225, '<td valign="top">One of the better photos in the challenge to be sure. The sky seems a bit odd, but otherwise nice.</td>', 'One of the better photos in the challenge to be sure. The sky seems a bit odd, but otherwise nice.', '2014-08-16 12:44:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7251969, 1127245, 114225, '<td valign="top">The bottom third of this is a bit darker, strange.<br/>The clouds have a bit too much structure.<br/>Otherwise, ok.</td>', 'The bottom third of this is a bit darker, strange.The clouds have a bit too much structure.Otherwise, ok.', '2014-08-16 12:45:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7251971, 1127343, 114225, '<td valign="top">Good scene, and great time of day for HDR. Some things to watch out for. Part of the cliff is oddly dark. And the colors in the sky are bit over the top.</td>', 'Good scene, and great time of day for HDR. Some things to watch out for. Part of the cliff is oddly dark. And the colors in the sky are bit over the top.', '2014-08-16 12:53:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7251972, 1127220, 114225, '<td valign="top">Interior HDR is often a good choice, as it is here. Nice colors. A little heavy on structure, but not too bad.</td>', 'Interior HDR is often a good choice, as it is here. Nice colors. A little heavy on structure, but not too bad.', '2014-08-16 12:53:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7251973, 1127340, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like this for the most part. A small improvement could be made with the light. Its grey, but it should really be bright white.</td>', 'I like this for the most part. A small improvement could be made with the light. Its grey, but it should really be bright white.', '2014-08-16 12:54:10.000000', NULL, 1),
