(7252049, 1127215, 54446, '<td valign="top">Long exposure.  Good subjects.  I might have tried ghost reduction, but I suspect the wind was moving stuff a lot.  Maybe you did attempt ghost reduction.  The blurred vegetation is a distraction.  The long exposure probably required an ND filter to smooth out the water.</td>', 'Long exposure.  Good subjects.  I might have tried ghost reduction, but I suspect the wind was moving stuff a lot.  Maybe you did attempt ghost reduction.  The blurred vegetation is a distraction.  The long exposure probably required an ND filter to smooth out the water.', '2014-08-16 18:44:51.000000', NULL, 1),
