(7252051, 1127288, 54446, '<td valign="top">Great composition and a wonderful scene.  This is moderately underexposed on my screen (away from the unclouded sky), but that''s my only objection.  7</td>', 'Great composition and a wonderful scene.  This is moderately underexposed on my screen (away from the unclouded sky), but that''s my only objection.  7', '2014-08-16 18:46:47.000000', NULL, 1),
