(7252054, 1127238, 54446, '<td valign="top">Above average scene.  The horizon line is in an eye-pleasing place.  Overall, detail is distant.  May have benefitted from foreground elements of interest.</td>', 'Above average scene.  The horizon line is in an eye-pleasing place.  Overall, detail is distant.  May have benefitted from foreground elements of interest.', '2014-08-16 18:51:39.000000', NULL, 1),
