(7252056, 1127239, 54446, '<td valign="top">If it is a combination of images in HDR, it''s good control of the highlights and shadows  and pretty good ghost reduction control.  Seems a bit soft in focus here and there.  Needs a better composition.</td>', 'If it is a combination of images in HDR, it''s good control of the highlights and shadows  and pretty good ghost reduction control.  Seems a bit soft in focus here and there.  Needs a better composition.', '2014-08-16 18:54:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7252057, 1127325, 54446, '<td valign="top">I get the impression the day was overcast and maybe gray.   The smoky area in the upper left leaves me wondering if it is smoke.  Maybe it was.  overall, my impression is the scene could use a wider dynamic range going to some highlights and more black details.  This could be considered to be lacking contrast.</td>', 'I get the impression the day was overcast and maybe gray.   The smoky area in the upper left leaves me wondering if it is smoke.  Maybe it was.  overall, my impression is the scene could use a wider dynamic range going to some highlights and more black details.  This could be considered to be lacking contrast.', '2014-08-16 18:57:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7252059, 1127263, 54446, '<td valign="top">Is that a biker in the sunstar?  I definitely don''t like the lens flares.  Shadow details are restored, but at a cost.</td>', 'Is that a biker in the sunstar?  I definitely don''t like the lens flares.  Shadow details are restored, but at a cost.', '2014-08-16 19:00:13.000000', NULL, 1),
