(7252061, 1127097, 54446, '<td valign="top">Well, it''s a good subject for a still life.  You have restored detail in the shadows.  Difficult for the viewer and the effectiveness of the scene to look into the sun.  (That is, to look into the direction of the sun.)</td>', 'Well, it''s a good subject for a still life.  You have restored detail in the shadows.  Difficult for the viewer and the effectiveness of the scene to look into the sun.  (That is, to look into the direction of the sun.)', '2014-08-16 19:03:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7252062, 1127245, 54446, '<td valign="top">You may have been shooting during a shady time of the day, as the scene lacks interesting highlights and shadows.  It''s flat to my eye.  Pretty nice clouds out there.  This subject has potential.  I think it needs a bit more interesting composition.</td>', 'You may have been shooting during a shady time of the day, as the scene lacks interesting highlights and shadows.  It''s flat to my eye.  Pretty nice clouds out there.  This subject has potential.  I think it needs a bit more interesting composition.', '2014-08-16 19:06:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7252063, 1127240, 54446, '<td valign="top">Some scenes lend themselves to a symmetrical composition.  This is one of those scenes.  Excuse me for saying this, but the sky looks like "end of days".  Good detail.  Maybe not a great subject for blending multiple images with the moving water and distracting people.</td>', 'Some scenes lend themselves to a symmetrical composition.  This is one of those scenes.  Excuse me for saying this, but the sky looks like "end of days".  Good detail.  Maybe not a great subject for blending multiple images with the moving water and distracting people.', '2014-08-16 19:08:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7252064, 1127276, 54446, '<td valign="top">It''s an okay scene.  You certainly restored most of the detail in the shadows.  The bright highlights make me squint.  I might have shot from a 180º opposite perspective, but I wasn''t there.</td>', 'It''s an okay scene.  You certainly restored most of the detail in the shadows.  The bright highlights make me squint.  I might have shot from a 180º opposite perspective, but I wasn''t there.', '2014-08-16 19:11:08.000000', NULL, 1),
