(7253435, 1127035, 54446, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately, this is the kind and quality of image which comes to mind to some from the early incarnations of HDR software.  Not at all natural.  I would label this HDR 2003.   Serious moire pattern in the grill.  Not any way near the kind of result possible with modern application of HDR software.</td>', 'Unfortunately, this is the kind and quality of image which comes to mind to some from the early incarnations of HDR software.  Not at all natural.  I would label this HDR 2003.   Serious moire pattern in the grill.  Not any way near the kind of result possible with modern application of HDR software.', '2014-08-21 11:05:01.000000', NULL, 1),
